    {
      "mode": "managed",
      "type": "helm_release",
      "name": "gitlab",
      "provider": "provider[\"registry.opentofu.org/hashicorp/helm\"]",
      "instances": [
        {
          "schema_version": 1,
          "attributes": {
            "atomic": false,
            "chart": "./../helm/gitlab",
            "cleanup_on_fail": false,
            "create_namespace": false,
            "dependency_update": true,
            "description": null,
            "devel": null,
            "disable_crd_hooks": false,
            "disable_openapi_validation": false,
            "disable_webhooks": false,
            "force_update": false,
            "id": "gitlab",
            "keyring": null,
            "lint": false,
            "manifest": null,
            "max_history": 0,
            "metadata": [
              {
                "app_version": "",
                "chart": "gitlab",
                "first_deployed": 1787657328,
                "last_deployed": 1787657328,
                "name": "gitlab",
                "namespace": "gitlab",
                "notes": "CHART NAME: redis\nCHART VERSION: 16.13.2\nAPP VERSION: 6.2.7\n\n** Please be patient while the chart is being deployed **\n\nRedis\u0026reg; can be accessed via port 6379 on the following DNS name from within your cluster:\n\n    gitlab-redis-master.gitlab.svc.cluster.local\n\n\n\nTo get your password run:\n\n    export REDIS_PASSWORD=$(kubectl get secret --namespace gitlab \"gitlab-redis-secret\" -o jsonpath=\"{.data.redis-password}\" | base64 -d)\n\nTo connect to your Redis\u0026reg; server:\n\n1. Run a Redis\u0026reg; pod that you can use as a client:\n\n   kubectl run --namespace gitlab redis-client --restart='Never'  --env REDIS_PASSWORD=$REDIS_PASSWORD  --image docker.io/bitnamilegacy/redis:6.2.16-debian-12-r3 --command -- sleep infinity\n\n   Use the following command to attach to the pod:\n\n   kubectl exec --tty -i redis-client \\\n   --namespace gitlab -- bash\n\n2. Connect using the Redis\u0026reg; CLI:\n   REDISCLI_AUTH=\"$REDIS_PASSWORD\" redis-cli -h gitlab-redis-master\n\nTo connect to your database from outside the cluster execute the following commands:\n\n    kubectl port-forward --namespace gitlab svc/gitlab-redis-master 6379:6379 \u0026\n    REDISCLI_AUTH=\"$REDIS_PASSWORD\" redis-cli -h 127.0.0.1 -p 6379\n\nCHART NAME: postgresql\nCHART VERSION: 12.5.2\nAPP VERSION: 15.3.0\n\n** Please be patient while the chart is being deployed **\n\nPostgreSQL can be accessed via port 5432 on the following DNS names from within your cluster:\n\n    gitlab-postgresql.gitlab.svc.cluster.local - Read/Write connection\n\nTo get the password for \"postgres\" run:\n\n    export POSTGRES_ADMIN_PASSWORD=$(kubectl get secret --namespace gitlab \"gitlab-postgresql-password\" -o jsonpath=\"{.data.postgresql-postgres-password}\" | base64 -d)\n\nTo get the password for \"gitlab\" run:\n\n    export POSTGRES_PASSWORD=$(kubectl get secret --namespace gitlab \"gitlab-postgresql-password\" -o jsonpath=\"{.data.\"postgresql-password\"}\" | base64 -d)\n\nTo connect to your database run the following command:\n\n    kubectl run gitlab-postgresql-client --rm --tty -i --restart='Never' --namespace gitlab --image docker.io/bitnamilegacy/postgresql:14.8.0 --env=\"PGPASSWORD=$POSTGRES_PASSWORD\" \\\n      --command -- psql --host gitlab-postgresql -U gitlab -d gitlabhq_production -p 5432\n\n    \u003e NOTE: If you access the container using bash, make sure that you execute \"/opt/bitnami/scripts/postgresql/entrypoint.sh /bin/bash\" in order to avoid the error \"psql: local user with ID 1001} does not exist\"\n\nTo connect to your database from outside the cluster execute the following commands:\n\n    kubectl port-forward --namespace gitlab svc/gitlab-postgresql 5432:5432 \u0026\n    PGPASSWORD=\"$POSTGRES_PASSWORD\" psql --host 127.0.0.1 -U gitlab -d gitlabhq_production -p 5432\n\nWARNING: The configured password will be ignored on new installation in case when previous Posgresql release was deleted through the helm command. In that case, old PVC will have an old password, and setting it through helm won't take effect. Deleting persistent volumes (PVs) will solve the issue.\n\n\n\n=== CRITICAL\nThe following charts are included for evaluation purposes only. They will not be supported by GitLab Support\nfor production workloads. Use Cloud Native Hybrid deployments for production. For more information visit\nhttps://docs.gitlab.com/charts/installation/index.html#use-the-reference-architectures.\n- PostgreSQL\n- Redis\n- Gitaly\n\n=== NOTICE\nThe minimum required version of PostgreSQL is now 14. See https://docs.gitlab.com/charts/installation/upgrade.html for more details.\nHelp us improve the installation experience, let us know how we did with a 1 minute survey:https://gitlab.fra1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_6kVqZANThUQ1bZb?installation=helm\u0026release=17-5\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMinio not enabled: `enabled: `. Please set to `true` to use Minio\n",
                "revision": 1,
                "values": "{\"gitlab\":{\"certmanager\":{\"install\":false},\"certmanager-issuer\":{\"email\":\"edwardlimkoksiong1994@gmail.com\"},\"gitlab\":{\"gitaly\":{\"resources\":{\"limits\":{\"memory\":\"512Mi\"},\"requests\":{\"cpu\":\"50m\",\"memory\":\"256Mi\"}}},\"gitlab-shell\":{\"maxReplicas\":1,\"minReplicas\":1},\"sidekiq\":{\"maxReplicas\":1,\"minReplicas\":1,\"resources\":{\"limits\":{\"memory\":\"1Gi\"},\"requests\":{\"cpu\":\"50m\",\"memory\":\"512Mi\"}}},\"toolbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"webservice\":{\"maxReplicas\":1,\"minReplicas\":1,\"resources\":{\"limits\":{\"memory\":\"2Gi\"},\"requests\":{\"cpu\":\"100m\",\"memory\":\"1Gi\"}}}},\"gitlab-runner\":{\"install\":false},\"global\":{\"appConfig\":{\"artifacts\":{\"bucket\":\"gitlab-artifacts\",\"enabled\":true},\"backups\":{\"bucket\":\"gitlab-backups\"},\"ciSecureFiles\":{\"bucket\":\"gitlab-ci-secure-files\",\"enabled\":true},\"dependencyProxy\":{\"bucket\":\"gitlab-dependency-proxy\",\"enabled\":true},\"externalDiffs\":{\"bucket\":\"gitlab-mr-diffs\",\"enabled\":true},\"lfs\":{\"bucket\":\"git-lfs\",\"enabled\":true},\"object_store\":{\"enabled\":true},\"omniauth\":{\"allowSingleSignOn\":[\"openid_connect\"],\"autoSignInWithProvider\":\"openid_connect\",\"blockAutoCreatedUsers\":false,\"enabled\":true,\"providers\":[{\"key\":\"provider\",\"secret\":\"gitlab-omniauth-authentik\"}]},\"packages\":{\"bucket\":\"gitlab-packages\",\"enabled\":true},\"terraformState\":{\"bucket\":\"gitlab-terraform-state\",\"enabled\":true},\"uploads\":{\"bucket\":\"gitlab-uploads\",\"enabled\":true}},\"edition\":\"ce\",\"hosts\":{\"domain\":\"gitlab.local\",\"gitlab\":{\"name\":\"gitlab.local\"}},\"hpa\":{\"apiVersion\":\"autoscaling/v2\"},\"ingress\":{\"annotations\":{\"cert-manager.io/cluster-issuer\":\"homelab-ca-issuer\"},\"apiVersion\":\"networking.k8s.io/v1\",\"class\":\"traefik\",\"configureCertmanager\":false,\"enabled\":true,\"provider\":\"traefik\",\"tls\":{\"enabled\":true,\"secretName\":\"gitlab-tls\"}},\"initialRootPassword\":{\"secret\":\"gitlab-initial-root-password\"},\"kas\":{\"enabled\":false},\"minio\":{\"enabled\":false},\"pdb\":{\"apiVersion\":\"policy/v1\"},\"traefik\":{\"apiVersion\":\"traefik.io/v1alpha1\"}},\"grafana\":{\"enabled\":false},\"nginx-ingress\":{\"enabled\":false},\"postgresql\":{\"auth\":{\"password\":\"(sensitive value)\"},\"image\":{\"repository\":\"bitnamilegacy/postgresql\"},\"install\":true,\"metrics\":{\"image\":{\"repository\":\"bitnamilegacy/postgres-exporter\"}},\"primary\":{\"resources\":{\"limits\":{\"memory\":\"512Mi\"},\"requests\":{\"cpu\":\"50m\",\"memory\":\"256Mi\"}}}},\"prometheus\":{\"install\":false},\"redis\":{\"image\":{\"repository\":\"bitnamilegacy/redis\",\"tag\":\"6.2.16-debian-12-r3\"},\"install\":true,\"master\":{\"resources\":{\"limits\":{\"memory\":\"128Mi\"},\"requests\":{\"cpu\":\"25m\",\"memory\":\"64Mi\"}}},\"metrics\":{\"image\":{\"repository\":\"bitnamilegacy/redis-exporter\",\"tag\":\"1.76.0-debian-12-r0\"}}},\"registry\":{\"enabled\":false}}}",
                "version": "0.1.0"
              }
            ],
